A boy from the kart tracks who captured the sun,  
A lifetime of lightning in thirty-four run.  
He lived for the apex, he died at the lead,  
The king of the asphalt, the spirit of speed.  
Though the engine is quiet, the track is now bare,  
The ghost of the champion still rides on the air.
